01:35:45,270 --> 01:35:46,910
Ooh, I can make that now.

1380
01:35:49,790 --> 01:35:50,490
Wait, can I?

1381
01:35:52,250 --> 01:35:56,590
Bee cloak, because it starts to fall, releases bees, and douses the user in honey when damaged.

1382
01:35:58,270 --> 01:35:58,450
Wow.

1383
01:36:00,610 --> 01:36:01,430
Okay, okay.

1384
01:36:01,890 --> 01:36:04,950
Wow, you can really become a bee person.

1385
01:36:06,490 --> 01:36:07,270
If you want.

1386
01:36:09,290 --> 01:36:10,090
That's amazing.

1387
01:36:10,570 --> 01:36:13,970
Causes stars to fall and increases length of invincibility after taking damage.

1388
01:36:16,850 --> 01:36:19,130
I mean, that sounds pretty good.

1389
01:36:19,830 --> 01:36:21,850
Especially for someone like me who takes a lot of damage.

1390
01:36:22,770 --> 01:36:24,490
But I don't have a cross necklace.

1391
01:36:26,130 --> 01:36:27,030
Can I not make this?

1392
01:36:33,450 --> 01:36:34,410
Did I put it in here?

1393
01:36:38,910 --> 01:36:39,970
Oh, wait, I made this.

1394
01:36:40,350 --> 01:36:41,550
But does that count still?

1395
01:36:42,470 --> 01:36:42,790
I wonder.

1396
01:36:44,890 --> 01:36:46,110
No, wait, this is not a material.

1397
01:36:46,810 --> 01:36:47,930
Do I have another mana flower?

1398
01:36:49,110 --> 01:36:50,090
I feel like I got multiple.

1399
01:36:52,870 --> 01:36:53,410
Didn't I?

1400
01:36:58,130 --> 01:36:58,890
Maybe it didn't.

1401
01:37:02,220 --> 01:37:04,360
Snake charmer's thingy.

1402
01:37:08,890 --> 01:37:10,090
Immunities of curse.

1403
01:37:12,150 --> 01:37:12,390
Hmm.

1404
01:37:15,090 --> 01:37:15,830
I don't remember.

1405
01:37:17,510 --> 01:37:18,590
Maybe it didn't.

1406
01:37:23,300 --> 01:37:23,720
Okay.

1407
01:37:25,620 --> 01:37:25,900
No!

1408
01:37:28,180 --> 01:37:29,320
What else can you tell me?

1409
01:37:29,760 --> 01:37:30,460
Living fire block.

1410
01:37:34,110 --> 01:37:34,490
Oh.

1411
01:37:35,470 --> 01:37:36,230
Okay.

1412
01:37:37,390 --> 01:37:38,390
I can make a...

1413
01:37:39,190 --> 01:37:40,410
blocks that light up, it seems.

1414
01:37:41,110 --> 01:37:41,690
Could be cool.

1415
01:37:42,450 --> 01:37:43,090
The plumber's hat.

1416
01:37:43,150 --> 01:37:44,150
I kind of want to put that on.

1417
01:37:49,110 --> 01:37:49,850
Wait, why am I not...

1418
01:37:56,370 --> 01:37:57,750
Oh, it's because I have this one on.

1419
01:37:58,850 --> 01:37:59,430
Get rid of that.

1420
01:38:00,370 --> 01:38:01,390
I want to look like Mario.

1421
01:38:02,830 --> 01:38:03,930
The precise bone helm.

1422
01:38:04,350 --> 01:38:05,170
Let's put this one.

1423
01:38:05,890 --> 01:38:06,430
Is that a material?

1424
01:38:06,770 --> 01:38:07,130
It's not.

1425
01:38:08,310 --> 01:38:10,130
Put it in here, I guess.

1426
01:38:13,360 --> 01:38:14,020
Oh, why did I just put it in?

1427
01:38:14,280 --> 01:38:15,280
No, keep that for now.

1428
01:38:17,200 --> 01:38:19,180
I'm going to need to knock back the fire.

1429
01:38:21,340 --> 01:38:21,500
Hmm.

1430
01:38:24,280 --> 01:38:26,360
This one is actually not that great.

1431
01:38:28,100 --> 01:38:32,160
If you think about it, this one could easily be replaced.

1432
01:38:35,200 --> 01:38:35,520
Right?

1433
01:38:36,660 --> 01:38:37,880
That's not that great.

1434
01:38:39,780 --> 01:38:40,800
At least I don't think so.

1435
01:38:43,980 --> 01:38:44,400
Okay.

1436
01:38:44,840 --> 01:38:47,080
By the way, the soul of light.

1437
01:38:47,860 --> 01:38:49,100
We could make a key.

1438
01:38:51,280 --> 01:38:51,640
Key of light.

1439
01:38:51,940 --> 01:38:52,820
We need 15 for that.

1440
01:38:53,500 --> 01:38:57,020
I think that key goes in one of the chests I found here.

1441
01:38:58,620 --> 01:39:03,940
Remember, we found a bunch of chests in this area that we never found the key for.

1442
01:39:05,300 --> 01:39:09,560
So this one has to go into one of these, is what I'm thinking.

1443
01:39:12,100 --> 01:39:12,500
Yeah.

1444
01:39:13,220 --> 01:39:13,680
Now, Azure.

1445
01:39:13,680 --> 01:39:16,140
What a beautiful night.

1446
01:39:16,400 --> 01:39:19,040
With your recent victory, the world seems more at peace.

1447
01:39:19,340 --> 01:39:21,220
And these lanterns are in celebration of that.

1448
01:39:22,720 --> 01:39:24,040
But, hold on now.

1449
01:39:24,160 --> 01:39:26,240
Didn't you just tell me I just unleashed something?

1450
01:39:27,960 --> 01:39:30,160
Unless you meant that I unleashed the lanterns.

1451
01:39:31,940 --> 01:39:34,260
It's like you're contradicting yourself here a little bit.

1452
01:39:36,180 --> 01:39:39,400
I think I saw a treasure map floating around in the ocean once.

1453
01:39:39,700 --> 01:39:40,820
But a shark ate it.

1454
01:39:41,460 --> 01:39:43,000
Maybe you should go try and find one.

1455
01:39:44,440 --> 01:39:45,500
Bro, say no more.

1456
01:39:46,080 --> 01:39:47,160
I was hidden there anyway.

1457
01:39:48,860 --> 01:39:49,840
Let's try that, actually.

1458
01:39:50,880 --> 01:39:51,960
Let me go check that out.

1459
01:39:53,320 --> 01:39:53,940
Also, Driskan.

1460
01:39:54,380 --> 01:39:55,320
I kind of need to speak to you.

1461
01:39:56,120 --> 01:39:57,980
Have you seen any me-burrs around here?

1462
01:39:59,520 --> 01:40:00,280
I have not.

1463
01:40:01,020 --> 01:40:01,760
I don't even know what that is.

1464
01:40:04,440 --> 01:40:07,440
Uh, give me two of these.

1465
01:40:09,120 --> 01:40:10,400
Because I want to try this again.

1466
01:40:12,220 --> 01:40:13,060
And... Mortal.

1467
01:40:14,400 --> 01:40:16,420
Would you rather have a bullet hole or a grenade hole?

1468
01:40:16,920 --> 01:40:17,680
That's what I thought.

1469
01:40:18,840 --> 01:40:19,220
Oh, well.

1470
01:40:22,830 --> 01:40:24,250
Wait, explosive powder.

1471
01:40:24,410 --> 01:40:24,810
Isn't that new?

1472
01:40:28,280 --> 01:40:29,280
I'm gonna try that.

1473
01:40:29,520 --> 01:40:29,820
Thank you.

1474
01:40:30,600 --> 01:40:31,460
I'll be taking that.

1475
01:40:32,900 --> 01:40:33,300
Okay.

1476
01:40:35,680 --> 01:40:36,660
Let's go up here.

1477
01:40:40,080 --> 01:40:40,240
Oops.

1478
01:40:41,320 --> 01:40:42,000
Here we go.

1479
01:40:44,300 --> 01:40:45,820
This place is so weird.

1480
01:40:47,200 --> 01:40:51,080
God, I'm so happy I finally beat that stupid boss.

1481
01:40:51,820 --> 01:40:52,860
It feels amazing.

1482
01:40:53,940 --> 01:40:58,280
It's the same feeling I have right now after beating a really tough section of Rainworld, you know?

1483
01:40:58,740 --> 01:41:05,800
Is that really sweet feeling of victory after so long of failure?

1484
01:41:06,880 --> 01:41:08,280
It's the best feeling ever.

1485
01:41:13,370 --> 01:41:14,950
Has that moon always been there?

1486
01:41:15,550 --> 01:41:15,990
That green moon?

1487
01:41:17,050 --> 01:41:18,390
Am I noticing new things here?

1488
01:41:19,050 --> 01:41:19,410
Izzy?

1489
01:41:20,710 --> 01:41:21,570
I might have a job for you.

1490
01:41:21,650 --> 01:41:22,610
Don't think you can say no either.

1491
01:41:22,730 --> 01:41:23,430
Well, in that case...

1492
01:41:24,210 --> 01:41:24,570
It's a whale!

1493
01:41:24,970 --> 01:41:25,490
It's a dolphin!

1494
01:41:25,710 --> 01:41:26,810
No, it's a penguin fish.

1495
01:41:27,050 --> 01:41:27,970
Oh, not again.

1496
01:41:29,250 --> 01:41:29,730
Surface tundra?

1497
01:41:30,310 --> 01:41:30,810
I don't want it.

1498
01:41:31,810 --> 01:41:33,930
Hey, what's that up to?

1499
01:41:34,070 --> 01:41:34,510
Have you...

1500
01:41:34,510 --> 01:41:35,530
Have you talked to me by chance?

1501
01:41:36,730 --> 01:41:37,290
I have not.

1502
01:41:38,610 --> 01:41:38,630
Oh.

1503
01:41:40,370 --> 01:41:40,690
Oh.

1504
01:41:41,670 --> 01:41:42,310
What do you...

1505
01:41:42,310 --> 01:41:42,670
What's that?

1506
01:41:44,110 --> 01:41:44,650
Rubble maker.

1507
01:41:47,510 --> 01:41:47,870
Dolphins.

1508
01:41:47,870 --> 01:41:48,810
Calm down.

1509
01:41:50,390 --> 01:41:51,270
Let's see here.

1510
01:41:51,710 --> 01:41:52,230
Can be placed.

1511
01:41:52,750 --> 01:41:54,730
Used with materials to place matching rubble.

1512
01:41:55,810 --> 01:41:57,750
Right click to toggle placement size.

1513
01:41:59,350 --> 01:41:59,550
What?

1514
01:42:03,840 --> 01:42:04,340
Rubble maker.

1515
01:42:07,220 --> 01:42:08,740
Well, I'm...

1516
01:42:08,740 --> 01:42:09,380
Mummy?

1517
01:42:11,540 --> 01:42:12,700
Excuse me?

1518
01:42:14,860 --> 01:42:15,660
Mummy mask.

1519
01:42:19,310 --> 01:42:20,070
The mummy is new.

1520
01:42:22,330 --> 01:42:23,250
I haven't seen the mummy.

1521
01:42:24,130 --> 01:42:24,710
Eat the cake.

1522
01:42:27,710 --> 01:42:28,070
Um...

1523
01:42:28,070 --> 01:42:29,410
I should have brought my gills.

1524
01:42:37,730 --> 01:42:38,090
Shit.

1525
01:42:38,550 --> 01:42:39,710
That was the one thing I wanted to do.

1526
01:42:41,230 --> 01:42:41,950
I need gills.

1527
01:42:42,510 --> 01:42:43,330
I have gills potion.

1528
01:42:46,150 --> 01:42:47,290
I have it right here, actually.

1529
01:42:49,650 --> 01:42:50,490
Look, five of them.

1530
01:42:51,130 --> 01:42:51,950
Breathe water instead of air.

1531
01:42:53,630 --> 01:42:55,210
And I have a flipper one, don't I?

1532
01:42:55,590 --> 01:42:56,250
Or did I use that?

1533
01:42:57,330 --> 01:42:59,210
Let's try the water walking as well.

1534
01:43:01,990 --> 01:43:02,770
And this one.

1535
01:43:05,190 --> 01:43:06,270
This one can be deleted.

1536
01:43:08,310 --> 01:43:09,510
Actually, what I want to do right now.

1537
01:43:11,110 --> 01:43:12,890
I want to do something very nice.

1538
01:43:14,950 --> 01:43:15,910
Where's the empty...

1539
01:43:15,910 --> 01:43:16,750
Where's the water bottles?

1540
01:43:18,550 --> 01:43:19,850
I don't know where I put them.

1541
01:43:21,950 --> 01:43:22,670
Did I put them here?

1542
01:43:22,830 --> 01:43:22,970
I did.

1543
01:43:24,290 --> 01:43:24,990
All right, Ash.

1544
01:43:25,450 --> 01:43:25,710
Asher.

1545
01:43:27,270 --> 01:43:28,130
Water bottle.

1546
01:43:29,590 --> 01:43:30,010
Bottled water.

1547
01:43:32,630 --> 01:43:33,510
I want to make...

1548
01:43:36,950 --> 01:43:37,450
This.

1549
01:43:38,790 --> 01:43:39,630
Ah, I can't!

1550
01:43:40,710 --> 01:43:42,350
I need chaos fish for that.

1551
01:43:45,150 --> 01:43:47,830
I need to really figure out how to get all these items.

1552
01:43:49,030 --> 01:43:51,010
Where the heck am I gonna find chaos fish?

1553
01:43:52,370 --> 01:43:53,510
In a chaos biome.

1554
01:43:55,270 --> 01:43:56,970
But that seems to me like...

1555
01:43:58,350 --> 01:43:59,350
This one down here.

1556
01:43:59,930 --> 01:44:00,310
Right?

1557
01:44:00,750 --> 01:44:02,130
Isn't that the closest thing to chaos?

1558
01:44:03,510 --> 01:44:06,090
Anyway, now that I got the Eternia crystal, I can try this real quick.

1559
01:44:06,590 --> 01:44:07,870
Before I go back to the east.

1560
01:44:09,830 --> 01:44:11,090
And I also have my thingy.

1561
01:44:12,230 --> 01:44:12,410
There.

1562
01:44:13,370 --> 01:44:14,310
Let's try this now.

1563
01:44:16,390 --> 01:44:17,830
Once again, we try this.

1564
01:44:20,930 --> 01:44:21,650
You know what?

1565
01:44:22,510 --> 01:44:23,350
Can I put it up here?

1566
01:44:24,570 --> 01:44:25,690
On top of Hailey's house?

1567
01:44:28,290 --> 01:44:29,350
Well, how about we do that?

1568
01:44:30,990 --> 01:44:34,070
The Eternia crystal rejects this area and pops away instantly.

1569
01:44:35,070 --> 01:44:35,870
Yeah, okay.

1570
01:44:36,450 --> 01:44:36,630
Fine.

1571
01:44:37,870 --> 01:44:38,350
All right.

1572
01:44:40,250 --> 01:44:41,030
That's fair enough.

1573
01:44:43,630 --> 01:44:46,430
Actually, the spot I was in was kind of decent.

1574
01:44:54,500 --> 01:44:56,160
I mean, this spot right here is actually okay.

1575
01:44:59,530 --> 01:44:59,910
There we go.

1576
01:45:01,390 --> 01:45:01,830
What?

1577
01:45:02,470 --> 01:45:02,750
Really?

1578
01:45:03,910 --> 01:45:04,870
Wait, where did I put it before?

1579
01:45:07,390 --> 01:45:09,530
Oh, is it because I built a house for Hailey?

1580
01:45:14,810 --> 01:45:15,250
Maybe...

1581
01:45:15,250 --> 01:45:16,910
Probably what's happening here, right?

1582
01:45:19,130 --> 01:45:21,130
Okay, what's the large flat area?

1583
01:45:25,350 --> 01:45:26,690
I don't even see one.

1584
01:45:30,400 --> 01:45:31,720
Could I just make my own?

1585
01:45:37,410 --> 01:45:38,030
Let's see here.

1586
01:45:40,170 --> 01:45:40,190
Mud?

1587
01:45:40,650 --> 01:45:41,610
I have a lot of mud.

1588
01:45:42,590 --> 01:45:44,030
I could use mud, I guess.

1589
01:45:45,970 --> 01:45:46,670
Or stone.

1590
01:45:48,550 --> 01:45:48,990
Dirt.

1591
01:45:49,170 --> 01:45:49,770
Let's use dirt.

1592
01:45:55,080 --> 01:45:55,840
Let's make it...

1593
01:45:58,320 --> 01:45:59,900
Actually, maybe the desert will be fine.

1594
01:46:01,440 --> 01:46:02,260
Let's try that.

1595
01:46:06,020 --> 01:46:07,220
Nah, it's not that flat, is it?

1596
01:46:10,100 --> 01:46:10,840
Will this count?

1597
01:46:12,700 --> 01:46:13,380
Maybe this is...

1598
01:46:14,160 --> 01:46:15,080
Okay, we'll see.

1599
01:46:19,270 --> 01:46:20,310
Please get rid of that shit.

1600
01:46:23,380 --> 01:46:23,800
Dammit!

1601
01:46:30,350 --> 01:46:30,770
Grape!

1602
01:46:34,110 --> 01:46:34,990
All right.

1603
01:46:38,480 --> 01:46:40,360
Get rid of this crap!

1604
01:46:42,760 --> 01:46:43,420
There we go!

1605
01:46:44,040 --> 01:46:44,500
It's happening.

1606
01:46:44,940 --> 01:46:46,060
Probably not the best spot, actually.

1607
01:46:47,720 --> 01:46:48,420
Oh, I have an idea.

1608
01:46:49,900 --> 01:46:50,060
Bees!

1609
01:46:54,240 --> 01:46:54,460
Wait!

1610
01:46:57,340 --> 01:46:58,600
Wait a minute, this is different.

1611
01:47:02,890 --> 01:47:04,550
Oh, is it because I'm in the desert, maybe?

1612
01:47:06,150 --> 01:47:06,590
Different...

1613
01:47:06,590 --> 01:47:08,890
It's like biome-specific.

1614
01:47:10,410 --> 01:47:11,630
That's actually kind of cool.

1615
01:47:15,250 --> 01:47:16,790
I should just be standing up here, actually.

1616
01:47:19,390 --> 01:47:19,610
Bees!

1617
01:47:21,530 --> 01:47:22,490
How do you like them, bees?

1618
01:47:27,900 --> 01:47:28,700
Ethereum Goblin.

1619
01:47:32,970 --> 01:47:34,370
Oh, man, I think I'm going to fail this.

1620
01:47:34,450 --> 01:47:35,430
This is already kind of difficult.

1621
01:47:37,410 --> 01:47:38,610
And we're at the very beginning.

1622
01:47:44,310 --> 01:47:45,350
What the hell?

1623
01:47:47,910 --> 01:47:49,370
Why is this so much more difficult?

1624
01:47:51,510 --> 01:47:52,450
Are we done?

1625
01:47:53,850 --> 01:47:54,390
Next one?

1626
01:47:55,250 --> 01:47:55,790
Ethereum Mana.

1627
01:47:56,750 --> 01:47:56,770
Huh.

1628
01:47:58,690 --> 01:48:02,990
Wait a minute, I kind of want to try this one some more.

1629
01:48:06,550 --> 01:48:07,190
Laser them down.

1630
01:48:11,790 --> 01:48:13,010
And as soon as we're empty, we switch.

1631
01:48:21,330 --> 01:48:22,950
Probably should have used my potions here as well.

1632
01:48:31,080 --> 01:48:32,440
Bro, this weapon is actually decent.

1633
01:48:36,210 --> 01:48:36,530
Yeah.

1634
01:48:37,930 --> 01:48:38,550
It's nice.

1635
01:48:44,270 --> 01:48:46,230
It's actually way better than what I have here.

1636
01:48:47,470 --> 01:48:50,410
Or not way better, but it's definitely nice.

1637
01:48:51,750 --> 01:48:53,130
Oh, mysterious portal.

1638
01:48:53,390 --> 01:48:53,890
That's where they emerge.

1639
01:48:55,890 --> 01:48:56,090
Cool.

1640
01:48:56,810 --> 01:48:57,570
Also, this one is helping.

1641
01:48:57,790 --> 01:48:58,670
Brisk Sorcerer Emblem.

1642
01:48:59,930 --> 01:49:00,350
For show.

1643
01:49:01,470 --> 01:49:02,370
Let me actually drink this.

1644
01:49:06,330 --> 01:49:08,510
And also...

1645
01:49:08,510 --> 01:49:09,330
I think we're okay.

1646
01:49:13,340 --> 01:49:14,620
Oh my god, this weapon is amazing.

1647
01:49:19,900 --> 01:49:21,040
Look at that guy.

1648
01:49:23,560 --> 01:49:24,360
It's a big ogre.

1649
01:49:26,640 --> 01:49:28,400
Ethereum Javelin Thrower.

1650
01:49:29,520 --> 01:49:30,940
Oh, don't you throw that shit at me.

1651
01:49:32,600 --> 01:49:32,820
Oh!

1652
01:49:33,860 --> 01:49:35,640
Oh, they are throwing now.

1653
01:49:38,630 --> 01:49:39,490
I think I'm getting overrun.

1654
01:49:45,310 --> 01:49:46,110
